sux-deployment_preface.sh|28|10|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|        Streams selected development files directly to a target machine.|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|29|11|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|30|12|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|    release-manager.sh|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|31|13|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|        Standalone release acquisition, installation, update, rollback,|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|32|14|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|        reinstallation, and removal.|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|33|15|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|34|16|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|Together they cover the two main deployment scenarios:|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|35|17|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|36|18|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|    Development deployment|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|37|19|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|        Fast transfer of selected workspace files without creating a formal release.|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|38|20|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|39|21|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|    Release deployment|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
