sux-bootstrap_preface.sh|219|201|Why Bootstrap Matters|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|The bootstrap layer exists to keep scripts boring in the best possible way.|sux-bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Why Bootstrap Matters:
