sgnd-bootstrap.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Bootstrap Core|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides the central bootstrap mechanism for all SolidGroundUX scripts.|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Orchestrates framework initialization sequence|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Loads core and declared libraries (SGND_USING)|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Parses and separates framework and script arguments|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Initializes environment, configuration, and runtime state|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Applies standard execution flow for all scripts|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Ensures consistent startup behavior across all tools|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|24|13||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Single entry point for framework initialization|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Deterministic and repeatable startup sequence|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Explicit dependency loading via SGND_USING|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Minimal assumptions about script context|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|29|18||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|30|19||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Central orchestrator of the SolidGroundUX runtime|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Bridges bootstrap environment, argument parsing, and module loading|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody|  - Ensures every script runs within a fully initialized framework context|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|34|23||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|35|24||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Business logic execution|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody|  - UI rendering or interaction handling|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody|  - Application-specific behavior|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|39|28||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
