ui-glyphs.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - UI Glyphs|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Defines reusable glyphs, symbols, and character helpers for use in|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody|  console output across the SolidGroundUX framework.|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|16|5||||normal|||modulebody||ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|17|6||||label|||modulebody|The library|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides box-drawing characters and layout elements|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Defines commonly used symbols (checkmarks, arrows, separators, etc.)|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Encapsulates Unicode and ASCII fallbacks where needed|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports consistent visual language across all UI components|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody||ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|23|12||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Centralize glyph definitions to avoid duplication|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Prefer readability and consistency over decorative complexity|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Allow graceful fallback for terminals with limited Unicode support|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep rendering concerns separate from glyph definition|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody||ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|29|18||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|30|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Foundational visual layer used by ui.sh and related UI modules|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Supports consistent styling across all console tools|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody||ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|33|22||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|34|23||||normal|||modulebody|  - Rendering logic or layout behavior|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Terminal capability detection beyond basic fallback handling|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Theme or color management|ui-glyphs.sh::::
ui-glyphs.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody||ui-glyphs.sh::::
