ui-dlg.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - UI Dialogs|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Implements dialog-oriented interaction patterns for console applications.|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides higher-level dialog constructs built on top of ui-ask|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports timed prompts with auto-continue behavior|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Normalizes user responses into consistent action tokens|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Enables structured interaction flows such as confirmations and selections|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Integrates with UI rendering for consistent look and feel|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|23|12||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Build on top of primitive input helpers (ui-ask)|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Normalize interaction results for predictable scripting|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep dialogs lightweight and composable|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Support both interactive and semi-automated scenarios|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|29|18||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|30|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Intermediate interaction layer between raw input (ui-ask) and applications|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Used by scripts requiring structured or timed user decisions|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|33|22||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|34|23||||normal|||modulebody|  - Full-screen or TUI-style dialog systems|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Complex workflow/state engines|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Persistent dialog sessions|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
