sgnd-args.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Argument Parsing|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides a structured argument parsing system for SolidGroundUX scripts.|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Parses short and long command-line arguments|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports flags, values, and enumerated options|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Maps arguments to strongly defined variables|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Validates input against argument specifications|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Separates framework arguments from script-specific arguments|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Generates consistent help and usage output|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|24|13||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Declarative argument specification via SGND_ARGS_SPEC|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Predictable and consistent parsing behavior across scripts|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Clear separation between parsing and business logic|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Minimal runtime surprises through validation and normalization|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|29|18||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|30|19||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Core infrastructure for all executable scripts|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Used during bootstrap to interpret command-line input|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody|  - Enables standardized CLI behavior across the framework|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|34|23||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|35|24||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Complex subcommand frameworks (e.g., git-style commands)|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody|  - Interactive input handling (handled by ui-ask/ui-dlg)|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody|  - Dynamic runtime argument schema mutation|sgnd-args.sh::::
sgnd-args.sh|39|28||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-args.sh::::
