15-storage.sh|121|42|Console registration|||highlight|||L1Sectionbody|Storage|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|122|43|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Configure storage|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|123|44|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Provision one or more unused disks as persistent local storage.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|124|45|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Mount storage|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|125|46|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Mount a configured local storage filesystem.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|126|47|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Unmount storage|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|127|48|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Unmount a configured storage filesystem while keeping its persistent configuration.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|128|49|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Expand storage|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|129|50|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Expand the partition and filesystem after enlarging its disk.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|130|51|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Reconcile storage configuration|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|131|52|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Update SolidGroundUX storage configuration from all managed SGND_STORAGE volumes.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|132|53|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Reconcile storage persistence|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|133|54|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Remove only stale SolidGroundUX-managed storage entries from /etc/fstab.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|134|55|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Validate storage provisioning|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|135|56|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Run active checks including configuration reconciliation.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|136|57|Console registration|||emphasis|||L1Sectionbody|Show storage status|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
15-storage.sh|137|58|Console registration|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|  > Show local disks and configured storage status.|15-storage.sh:::Console registration:
