doc-generator.sh|3|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX SDK - Documentation Generator Script|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|15|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|16|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides the executable entry point for documentation data collection.|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|17|4||||normal|||modulebody||doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|18|5||||label|||modulebody|The script|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|19|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Bootstraps the SolidGroundUX runtime|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|20|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Resolves source and output parameters from arguments, state, or user input|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|21|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Collects normalized documentation data from matching source files|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|22|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Exports parser output and invokes the renderer pipeline|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|23|10||||normal|||modulebody||doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|24|11||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|25|12||||normal|||modulebody|  - Collection logic is kept separate from rendering logic|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|26|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Script behavior is deterministic and state-aware|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|27|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Framework conventions are reused wherever possible|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|28|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Interactive prompting remains optional rather than mandatory|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|29|16||||normal|||modulebody||doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|30|17||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|31|18||||normal|||modulebody|  - Executable entry point for documentation collection workflows|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|32|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Demonstrates canonical integration with sgnd-bootstrap and common libraries|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|33|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Bridges bootstrap, state, argument parsing, and collector execution|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|34|21||||normal|||modulebody||doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|35|22||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|36|23||||normal|||modulebody|  - Rendering output without the renderer component|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|37|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Parsing arbitrary free-form comments outside framework conventions|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|38|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Replacing the lower-level parser libraries|doc-generator.sh::::
