lib-template.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Library Template|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|14|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|15|3||||label|||modulebody|Provides the standard structure for framework libraries, including|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|16|4||||normal|||modulebody|    - canonical script header sections|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|17|5||||normal|||modulebody|    - library-only execution guard (must be sourced, never executed)|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|18|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - idempotent load guard|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|19|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - naming conventions for internal and public functions|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|20|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - reference function header layout|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|21|9||||normal|||modulebody||lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|22|10||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|23|11||||normal|||modulebody|  - Libraries define functions and constants only|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|24|12||||normal|||modulebody|  - No auto-execution (must always be sourced)|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|25|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep behavior deterministic and side-effect aware|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|26|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Separate mechanism (library) from policy (caller)|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|27|15||||normal|||modulebody||lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|28|16||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|29|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Base template for all SolidGroundUX library modules|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|30|18||||normal|||modulebody|  - Defines structure, conventions, and documentation standards|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|31|19||||normal|||modulebody||lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|32|20||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|33|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Executable scripts (use exe-template.sh)|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|34|22||||normal|||modulebody|  - Application logic|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|35|23||||normal|||modulebody|  - Framework bootstrap or path resolution|lib-template.sh::::
lib-template.sh|36|24||||normal|||modulebody||lib-template.sh::::
