doc-renderer.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX SDK - Documentation Renderer|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|14|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|15|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Converts parser-owned documentation tables into renderer input files and delegates|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|16|4||||normal|||modulebody|  final HTML generation to the Python documentation renderer.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|17|5||||normal|||modulebody||doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|18|6||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|19|7||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep parsing, export preparation, and final rendering separate.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|20|8||||normal|||modulebody|  - Use explicit table-shaped arrays and PSV files as intermediate models.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|21|9||||normal|||modulebody|  - Preserve deterministic ordering and stable content references.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|22|10||||normal|||modulebody|  - Avoid hidden relational behavior or synthetic database-like machinery.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|23|11||||normal|||modulebody||doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|24|12||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|25|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Post-processing and hand-off layer between doc-processor and concrete renderers.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|26|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Exports parser tables as the canonical input set for renderer implementations.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|27|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Invokes the Python HTML renderer for the current documentation output.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|28|16||||normal|||modulebody||doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|29|17||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|30|18||||normal|||modulebody|  - Parsing source files.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|31|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Owning source comment grammar.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|32|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Performing final format-specific rendering directly in Bash.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|33|21||||normal|||modulebody||doc-renderer.sh::::
